    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just eat and go viral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2306721,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as Nate, Elise, and Yosef demonstrate,"
